<title>USA: Apple Computer Inc Q4 shr profit.</title>
<headline>Apple Computer Inc Q4 shr profit.</headline>
<text>
<p>CUPERTINO, Calif., Oct 16 (Reuter)</p>
<p>		  Sept 27,  1996		 Sept 29, 1995</p>
<p> Shr     profit   $	0.20   profit	 $0.48</p>
<p> Net     profit	  25,000   profit	60,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,321,000		3,003,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 124,819		  124,741</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	loss    $	6.59   profit	 $3.45</p>
<p> Net	loss	  816,000   profit     424,000</p>
<p> Revs		   9,833,000	     11,062,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 123,734		  123,047</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note - 1996 Q4 includes gain of $0.14 a share or $17 million for adjustment in prior period restructuring charges.</p>
<p>1996 fiscal year loss includes after-tax inventory write-down of $388 million, restructuring charges of $113 million, and warranty and related expenses of $126 million, greater than historical rates would suggest.</p>
